+## Summary
+
+Build a fully local pipeline that ingests PDF/EPUB/TXT, cleans and chunks text,
+generates QA pairs with tags via Ollama 120B, stores vectors in ChromaDB, and
+exports JSONL for downstream RAG ingestion. The approach uses Python 3.11 with
+LangChain orchestration, Unstructured parsing, BGE-M3 embeddings, and explicit
+quality gates for fidelity and hallucination rate.
